        "summary": "Complex 1 is a linear Dy4 SMM. Room-temperature χMT is 56.60 cm3·mol−1·K under 1000 Oe, close to four uncoupled Dy(III) ions; χMT decreases to 50.25 cm3·mol−1·K at 46 K then rises to 64.61 cm3·mol−1·K at 2 K. Zero-field AC data (32–1000 Hz, 2–40 K) show frequency-dependent χ′ and χ″. Arrhenius fit gives Ueff = 110 K and τ0 = 1.03×10−6 s; an Orbach+QTM fit gives Ueff/kB = 104.06 K, τ0 = 1.50×10−6 s, and τQTM = 7.29×10−3 s.",
